      "writtenOn": "2019-11-21T08:46:32Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "It was added since:\n- this is a core API\n- uclamp supports RT tasks, which by default are considered latency sensitive\n- there was already discussions about possibly affect how RT tasks are placed on CPUs depending on their clamp values.\n\nThat said, you right, it\u0027s currently not used.",
      "parentUuid": "3199d1d1_0ad2c80a",
